cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use these measurements or the numbers derived from them, please cite this repository."
title: "kv-cache-lab: VRAM accounting for KV cache quantization on consumer GPUs"
abstract: >-
  A single-script measurement of what KV cache quantization saves in VRAM on a consumer
  GPU. Measured slopes are 32.11 +/- 1.24 KiB/token for f16 and 19.08 +/- 1.05 KiB/token
  for q8_0 on an RTX 4060 Laptop with Qwen2.5-1.5B, implying a fixed per-token overhead of
  roughly 4.1 KiB that quantization cannot discount.
authors:
